    {
      "id": "q-electron-security",
      "navLabel": "安全基线",
      "question": "Electron 安全应如何配置？nodeIntegration 与 contextIsolation 分别是什么？",
      "questionNote": "官方推荐：关 Node 注入、开上下文隔离、只经 contextBridge 暴露。",
      "answer": [
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "要点："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Electron 12 起 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "contextIsolation: true"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "、"
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "nodeIntegration: false"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 已是默认值，安全基线是「别把它们关掉」，并只经 contextBridge 暴露白名单 API。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1、"
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "nodeIntegration"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 为 true 时，页面脚本等同握有本机能力；一旦出现跨站脚本攻击（XSS），风险极大。新版还默认开启 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "sandbox"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "，让渲染进程跑在系统沙箱里，除非有特殊需求否则不要关闭。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2、"
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "contextIsolation"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 将 preload 与页面上下文隔离，只能用 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 显式挂载少量 API；不要将整个 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "ipcRenderer"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 挂到 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "window"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3、进一步收紧：不加载远程 URL；拦截 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "will-navigate"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 与 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "setWindowOpenHandler"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "，禁止应用内跳到外部站点或随意新开窗口；给页面加 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "Content-Security-Policy"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "，少用 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "unsafe-inline"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "4、其余：校验更新包签名、能力白名单、敏感操作一律在主进程再校验参数。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "示例："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "创建窗口时的安全配置（多为默认值，不宜改动）。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "new BrowserWindow({\n  webPreferences: {\n    preload: path.join(__dirname, 'preload.js'),\n    contextIsolation: true,   // 默认即 true\n    nodeIntegration: false,   // 默认即 false\n    sandbox: true,            // 默认即 true\n  },\n})"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "q-electron-ipc",
      "navLabel": "IPC 通信与示例",
      "question": "主进程与渲染进程如何通信？请用代码说明 invoke/handle 这条安全链路。",
      "questionNote": "推荐：页面 → preload（contextBridge）→ ipcRenderer.invoke → ipcMain.handle；注意进程间通信（IPC）只支持结构化克隆。",
      "answer": [
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "要点："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "请求-响应用 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "invoke/handle"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "；主进程主动推送用 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "webContents.send"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " + preload 转发的 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "on"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "主进程注册：通道名固定，参数校验后再执行敏感操作。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "// main.js\nconst { ipcMain, dialog } = require('electron')\n\nipcMain.handle('dialog:openFile', async () => {\n  const { canceled, filePaths } = await dialog.showOpenDialog({ properties: ['openFile'] })\n  if (canceled) return null\n  return filePaths[0] // 只回路径，勿暴露整个 fs\n})\n\nipcMain.handle('device:scan', async (_event, payload) => {\n  if (!payload || typeof payload.type !== 'string') throw new Error('invalid payload')\n  return { ok: true, type: payload.type }\n})"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "preload 白名单：只暴露业务方法，不暴露裸 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "ipcRenderer"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "；订阅要返回取消函数，避免泄漏。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "// preload.js\nconst { contextBridge, ipcRenderer } = require('electron')\n\ncontextBridge.exposeInMainWorld('api', {\n  openFile: () => ipcRenderer.invoke('dialog:openFile'),\n  scan: (type) => ipcRenderer.invoke('device:scan', { type }),\n  onUpdateProgress: (cb) => {\n    const listener = (_e, data) => cb(data)\n    ipcRenderer.on('update:progress', listener)\n    return () => ipcRenderer.removeListener('update:progress', listener)\n  },\n})"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "渲染进程只访问 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "window.api"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "；主进程推送用 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "win.webContents.send('update:progress', { percent: 42 })"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "边界：IPC 只能传"
          },
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "结构化克隆（structured clone）"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "支持的数据，函数、类实例、"
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "Symbol"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "、DOM 节点都传不过去，复杂对象要先序列化。"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
